{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "generated", "elements": [{"id": "T2IOB9h1ZgZNYnUfdBvr", "type": "frame", "x": 390, "y": 30, "width": 2339.2000000000003, "height": 1037, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#bbb", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0000", "roundness": null, "seed": 417626574, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 125632851, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "System diagram"}, {"id": "HrbOnpyN9C99pej0L48O", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": -40, "width": 1004.3000000000001, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 290473067, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1724049072, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Real-time messaging (WhatsApp): API first, inbox for durability, ordering as policy", "fontSize": 22, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Real-time messaging (WhatsApp): API first, inbox for durability, ordering as policy", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "bXPVJPN3gEtZ2peptVzU", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 20, "width": 569.8000000000001, "height": 157.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0002", "roundness": null, "seed": 1292590571, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 769188505, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Requirements: the five-question pack\n- group size cap? (DM = 2; groups 256 / 1,000; above = channel)\n- media types? text only or images / video (storage, throughput)\n- delete / edit semantics? for me, for everyone, within N min\n- multi-device policy? phone + tablet at once, per-device delivery state\n- presence accuracy? seconds or minutes; is last_seen needed?\nA user can: send / receive in DMs and groups \u00b7 see sent / delivered / read\n\u00b7 see who is online \u00b7 scroll history \u00b7 use several devices \u00b7 get push\nwhen offline \u00b7 create, rename, join, leave groups", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Requirements: the five-question pack\n- group size cap? (DM = 2; groups 256 / 1,000; above = channel)\n- media types? text only or images / video (storage, throughput)\n- delete / edit semantics? for me, for everyone, within N min\n- multi-device policy? phone + tablet at once, per-device delivery state\n- presence accuracy? seconds or minutes; is last_seen needed?\nA user can: send / receive in DMs and groups \u00b7 see sent / delivered / read\n\u00b7 see who is online \u00b7 scroll history \u00b7 use several devices \u00b7 get push\nwhen offline \u00b7 create, rename, join, leave groups", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "GlOF16Ge66DE5ppRPQZF", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 203.5, "width": 592.9000000000001, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0003", "roundness": null, "seed": 1804503366, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 968545368, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Technical challenges\n- delivery < 1 s p99 in region \u00b7 never lose a message (durable before ack)\n- availability over consistency: accept out-of-order arrival, render by ts\n- offline delivery and multi-device catch-up \u00b7 group fan-out cost\n- presence at scale without writing last_seen per heartbeat\n- 100M DAU x 10 msgs = 1B/day = 11.5k/s avg, 35k/s peak \u00b7 10M sockets\n  = ~10 gateways \u00b7 200 B/msg = 200 GB/day \u00b7 256-member group = 256 deliveries", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Technical challenges\n- delivery < 1 s p99 in region \u00b7 never lose a message (durable before ack)\n- availability over consistency: accept out-of-order arrival, render by ts\n- offline delivery and multi-device catch-up \u00b7 group fan-out cost\n- presence at scale without writing last_seen per heartbeat\n- 100M DAU x 10 msgs = 1B/day = 11.5k/s avg, 35k/s peak \u00b7 10M sockets\n  = ~10 gateways \u00b7 200 B/msg = 200 GB/day \u00b7 256-member group = 256 deliveries", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "5D53Ys7P4sYZDtijs5bl", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 352.0, "width": 585.2, "height": 157.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0004", "roundness": null, "seed": 1437144111, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 140444703, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Core entities\nUser(id, handle)   Device(id, user_id, platform, push_token)\nConversation(id, type dm|group, name); DM = exactly two members\nConversationMember(conversation_id, user_id, role, joined_at, muted)\nMessage(id monotonic per conversation, conversation_id, sender_id,\n        client_msg_id, sender_ts, server_ts, body) immutable\nReceipt(message_id, recipient_id, device_id, state, at)\nPresence(user_id -> online until TTL)   Inbox(recipient, device, message_id)\nNot entities: the socket, the notification", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Core entities\nUser(id, handle)   Device(id, user_id, platform, push_token)\nConversation(id, type dm|group, name); DM = exactly two members\nConversationMember(conversation_id, user_id, role, joined_at, muted)\nMessage(id monotonic per conversation, conversation_id, sender_id,\n        client_msg_id, sender_ts, server_ts, body) immutable\nReceipt(message_id, recipient_id, device_id, state, at)\nPresence(user_id -> online until TTL)   Inbox(recipient, device, message_id)\nNot entities: the socket, the notification", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "K50SZGROiKLxBGi5GUub", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 535.5, "width": 592.9000000000001, "height": 192.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0005", "roundness": null, "seed": 1750261700, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2045493810, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "API (write these before any box)\nPOST /conversations {type, member_ids, name}   GET /conversations?since&limit\nPOST /conversations/{id}/members   DELETE /conversations/{id}/members/{uid}\nPATCH /conversations/{id} {name}\nPOST /conversations/{id}/messages {client_msg_id, body, sender_ts}\n     -> {message_id, server_ts}   idempotent on client_msg_id\nGET /conversations/{id}/messages?since=message_id&limit\nPOST /messages/{id}/receipts {state}   GET /messages/{id}/receipts\nPATCH /users/{id}/presence (heartbeat)   GET /users/{id}/presence\nWS /ws frames: message, receipt, presence\nhot: send, read, receipt, heartbeat   cold: create, rename, add, leave", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "API (write these before any box)\nPOST /conversations {type, member_ids, name}   GET /conversations?since&limit\nPOST /conversations/{id}/members   DELETE /conversations/{id}/members/{uid}\nPATCH /conversations/{id} {name}\nPOST /conversations/{id}/messages {client_msg_id, body, sender_ts}\n     -> {message_id, server_ts}   idempotent on client_msg_id\nGET /conversations/{id}/messages?since=message_id&limit\nPOST /messages/{id}/receipts {state}   GET /messages/{id}/receipts\nPATCH /users/{id}/presence (heartbeat)   GET /users/{id}/presence\nWS /ws frames: message, receipt, presence\nhot: send, read, receipt, heartbeat   cold: create, rename, add, leave", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "a87dpss3ataVOw6DThuy", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 754.0, "width": 592.9000000000001, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0006", "roundness": null, "seed": 835204768, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 861846590, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "What breaks first\n- global ordering promised -> server id per conversation, render by sender_ts\n- bus as the only copy -> inbox row before publish, delete on ACK\n- last_seen written per heartbeat -> TTL key, offline = expiry\n- 1,000-member group on the send path -> fan-out workers + queue\n- leave without detaching push -> membership change updates push routing", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "What breaks first\n- global ordering promised -> server id per conversation, render by sender_ts\n- bus as the only copy -> inbox row before publish, delete on ACK\n- last_seen written per heartbeat -> TTL key, offline = expiry\n- 1,000-member group on the send path -> fan-out workers + queue\n- leave without detaching push -> membership change updates push routing", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "DfykRv3Pk02xGlvJlMZi", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 240, "width": 300, "height": 104, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f4f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "T2IOB9h1ZgZNYnUfdBvr", "index": "a0007", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 525839414, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 955975221, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "tFlsmbYTayrRD7zWID3o"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "7NIbauDgttnPy4UyqAPU"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "JfLWMtiv2Iae7iPc3aP1"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "2OzTKaCUsxW16nNfuTJ9"}], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "tFlsmbYTayrRD7zWID3o", "type": "text", "x": 430, "y": 265.75, "width": 280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "T2IOB9h1ZgZNYnUfdBvr", "index": "a0008", "roundness": null, "seed": 1944917887, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 892955458, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Devices (phone, tablet, web)\nWebSocket + REST fallback\nrender by sender_ts, flag late", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "DfykRv3Pk02xGlvJlMZi", "originalText": "Devices (phone, tablet, web)\nWebSocket + REST fallback\nrender by sender_ts, flag late", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "KiDVbWvFtWDCdTkLagMr", "type": "rectangle", "x": 940, "y": 240, "width": 300, "height": 104, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#dbeafe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "T2IOB9h1ZgZNYnUfdBvr", "index": "a0009", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1926677564, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1521371193, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "R6lH9aX285Xs2yqhyPGw"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "7NIbauDgttnPy4UyqAPU"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "OqXEyEvHotagJZ8qP5Vu"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "Wj1Z1gJ07ADl3zKvJpmm"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "JfLWMtiv2Iae7iPc3aP1"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "elct68ijRB7OYNe4grxJ"}], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "R6lH9aX285Xs2yqhyPGw", "type": "text", "x": 950, "y": 265.75, "width": 280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "T2IOB9h1ZgZNYnUfdBvr", "index": "a0010", "roundness": null, "seed": 1531704339, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1762296724, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "WebSocket gateways (~10)\nuserId \u2192 socket map\nconsistent hash, ring in etcd", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "KiDVbWvFtWDCdTkLagMr", "originalText": "WebSocket gateways (~10)\nuserId \u2192 socket map\nconsistent hash, ring in etcd", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "eMMDxCvylQ08xopbPiF1", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1460, "y": 60, "width": 300, "height": 104, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffedd5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "T2IOB9h1ZgZNYnUfdBvr", "index": "a0011", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2111841426, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1067216623, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "VLZLoe6hG2ZUcbGgnpXY"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "5LBA4LZ7ptJrotgEIrd7"}], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "VLZLoe6hG2ZUcbGgnpXY", "type": "text", "x": 1470, "y": 85.75, "width": 280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "T2IOB9h1ZgZNYnUfdBvr", "index": "a0012", "roundness": null, "seed": 468463004, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1422156185, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Conversation service (cold paths)\ncreate, rename, add, leave\nleave detaches push targets", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "eMMDxCvylQ08xopbPiF1", "originalText": "Conversation service (cold paths)\ncreate, rename, add, leave\nleave detaches push targets", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "l9vRWo4MQwTmuR1JJeDm", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1460, "y": 240, "width": 300, "height": 110, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffedd5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "T2IOB9h1ZgZNYnUfdBvr", "index": "a0013", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1265215704, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1711727359, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "J3ObCpEE7kUtDTl5fQAp"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "OqXEyEvHotagJZ8qP5Vu"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "lDKbZtshLmVKMJei5sBo"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "7RyC97CdQFja9bU44Mcp"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "2xkd1WMcfH2RuqGEgOd5"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "WUVQl5uf76wZkhHHE7VY"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "5LBA4LZ7ptJrotgEIrd7"}], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "J3ObCpEE7kUtDTl5fQAp", "type": "text", "x": 1470, "y": 260.0, "width": 280, "height": 70.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "T2IOB9h1ZgZNYnUfdBvr", "index": "a0014", "roundness": null, "seed": 937952916, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 267335010, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Message service (hot paths)\nassign server id + server_ts\nwrite message + inbox rows, then publish\nreceipts", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "l9vRWo4MQwTmuR1JJeDm", "originalText": "Message service (hot paths)\nassign server id + server_ts\nwrite message + inbox rows, then publish\nreceipts", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "VGhkgMMxQ56AxrvieWoQ", "type": "ellipse", "x": 1940, "y": 230, "width": 380, "height": 110, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#dcfce7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "T2IOB9h1ZgZNYnUfdBvr", "index": "a0015", "roundness": {"type": 2}, "seed": 206761788, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 486529894, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "At1xv5lQYNgAYeyQq71x"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "lDKbZtshLmVKMJei5sBo"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "FOFsYz0dpiuRScF18ew8"}], "updated": 1790734568256, "created": 1790734568256, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "At1xv5lQYNgAYeyQq71x", "type